- (To be completed)

## Recommendations (Initial)
- Ensure robust error handling for external API failures (Canvas, Craft, Telegram) to prevent whole-system instability (already mentioned in [CLAUDE.md](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/CLAUDE.md)).
- Monitor SQLite performance as the dataset (announcements, files) grows, though for personal use it should be sufficient.
